    "Bb5"
   ],
   "spoken": "This has become a reversed Nimzo-Indian, and the pin needs answering. A queen move handles it, but remember the rule — when a lesser piece can do the job, use it rather than the queen. Not every piece needs to be doing heavy work.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
  {
   "ply": 10,
   "t": 61.5,
   "fen": "r2qkb1r/pp1bpppp/2n2n2/1Bpp4/8/1P2PN2/PBPP1PPP/RN1QK2R w KQkq - 2 6",
