   "fen": "r2qkb1r/pp1bpppp/2n2n2/1Bpp4/8/1P2PN2/PBPP1PPP/RN1Q1RK1 b kq - 3 6",
   "line": [
    "O-O"
   ],
   "spoken": "To free the other bishop, avoid the fianchetto route — it would allow a capture that ruins the pawn structure in an unpleasant way. The modest pawn to e6 is the sounder path.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
  {
   "ply": 12,
   "t": 79,
