   "line": [
    "Qg5"
   ],
   "spoken": "Whenever the position transforms substantially, stop and ask the same question — how has it changed? The queen swings to g5 to occupy the newly opened lines. Re-evaluating after every big shift is what keeps you finding the right plan.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
  {
